    of art lovers with his vibrant and vibrant watercolours. Born in France in 1967,
    Alain discovered his passion for drawing at an early age, starting with simple
    pencil sketches on his school notebooks. However, it was in 1998 that he decided
    to explore the world of watercolour, a technique that allows him to express his
    unique vision of the world. '
