  m_text: "Every step you take here counts, and every calorie your avatar burns can
    be converted into currency. The visionary brands you discover in this world are
    rooted in the real world, with a shared mission to support your wellness and
    reward your energy. Just connect your Sixpack Miner account, charge batteries
    by burning calories, whether in the real world or here in MetaWorld,  and turn
    your energy into crypto or loyalty rewards. Let\u2019s move. Let\u2019s innovate.
    Let\u2019s earn, in both the physical and digital worlds, with Sixpack Miner."
